 "evidence": "The correction refitted on one year of one run, its cloud-free 3-day means on its own levels, with PlaSim's clear-sky longwave as a copy of its arithmetic against the atmosphere domain's correlated-k model on the same columns, both plane-parallel and without the curved air's escape. A refit on a short trial is provisional: the correction of a long run belongs to the configuration chosen for it, refitted on that configuration's columns. The cloud-free residuals are in sample; the sample of every column is not.",
